OL,3,GNEWSAMan shot dead as families gather
OL,4,Afor memorial
OL,5,
OL,6,FA murder investigation has been
OL,7,Flaunched after a 40-year-old man was
OL,8,Fshot dead in a "senseless act of
OL,9,Fviolence" as up to 50 people `
OL,10,Fincluding children ` gathered for a
OL,11,Fmemorial service in west London.
OL,13,FThe Met Police said it was called to
OL,14,Fthe scene at 19:47 GMT on Friday after
OL,15,Fmultiple shots had been heard by
OL,16,Fmembers of the public at the junction
OL,17,Fof Braybrook Street and Erconwald
OL,18,FStreet in East Acton.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,325,320,200,140,0,100
