OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMan shot dead as families gather
OL,4,Afor memorial
OL,5,
OL,6,FOfficers attended alongside the London
OL,7,FAmbulance Service but the man was
OL,8,Fpronounced dead at the scene, despite
OL,9,Fthe efforts of medics.
OL,11,FNo arrests have been made and a police
OL,12,Fcordon remains in place in Braybrook
OL,13,FStreet. Police are appealing for
OL,14,Fwitnesses to come forward.
